  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-intelligent-ui",
      "text": "**A [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) Web plugin: the model answers with an interface you can operate, not just text.**\n\n[](package.json)\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@left0ver/dsh-intelligent-ui)\n[](LICENSE)\n\nEnglish · [简体中文](README.zh.md)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **Appears as it is written**: each piece the model writes shows up at once.\n- **Runs locally**: dragging a slider, editing an input or switching a tab recalculates on the spot, with no further request to the model.\n- **Common controls**: sliders, inputs, selects, checkboxes, tabs, buttons, tables, progress bars, badges, callouts, collapsible sections, colour swatches, and line, bar, area and pie charts.\n- **Sandboxed**: the program the model writes runs in a sandbox, with no network and no access to the page's data."
    },
    {
      "section": "1. Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add @left0ver/dsh-intelligent-ui\n```\n\nA freshly published version may be held back by pnpm's minimum release age. If so, add these two lines to `~/.dsh/profiles/web/pnpm-workspace.yaml` and install again:\n\n```yaml\nminimumReleaseAgeExclude:\n  - '@left0ver/dsh-intelligent-ui'\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "2. Start",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh web\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "3. Ask",
      "text": "Ask for a calculator, a tool, a chart, or to adjust the numbers yourself. Ordinary questions are still answered in text. For example:\n\n```\nI take home $6,000 a month and spend $1,800 on rent, $700 on food, $300 on transport and $500 on fun. I want to save $50,000 for a down payment. Build me an interactive view of where my money goes and how long it will take.\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Update and uninstall",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web update @left0ver/dsh-intelligent-ui\ndsh plugin --profile web remove @left0ver/dsh-intelligent-ui\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Known limitations",
      "text": "- The interface's state is not saved: reloading the page resets it.\n- The model cannot see what you do in the interface, so a follow-up question does not know where you left the sliders."
    },
    {
      "section": "Acknowledgements",
      "text": "Thanks to [Disdjj/intelligent-ui-demo](https://github.com/Disdjj/intelligent-ui-demo) for its analysis of how OpenAI implements Intelligent UI, which this plugin builds on."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    }
